### Infrastructure & Operational Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@infraUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/infra
@infraSecret = change-this-to-a-secure-random-token
@superAdminToken = your_super_admin_sanctum_token_here
@regularUserToken = your_regular_user_sanctum_token_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Happy Paths
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Trigger Scheduler with Static Header Key (POST)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

### 2. Trigger Scheduler with Static Header Key (GET)
GET {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: {{infraSecret}}

### 3. Trigger Scheduler with Super Admin Sanctum Bearer Token (POST)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Sad Paths (Security Obscurity: Strictly Returns 404 Not Found)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Sad Path: Trigger without Any Credentials (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json

### 5. Sad Path: Trigger with Invalid Static Secret (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
X-Infra-Key: invalid-static-secret-token

### 6. Sad Path: Trigger with Regular User Token without Super Admin Role (Expects 404 Not Found)
POST {{infraUrl}}/scheduler
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{regularUserToken}}
